1
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:16,800
The rules keep changing.

2
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:25,640
I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.

3
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:36,080
Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.

4
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:44,720
I am resolved to sever this flood

5
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:51,080
so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,

6
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:55,440
from loneliness and distinction.

7
00:00:55,920 --> 00:01:00,400
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

8
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:05,400
Don't fall down.

9
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,600
I look towards the top.

10
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:11,240
Chase !

11
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:14,440
Refined to perfection.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,360
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

13
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,400
I dare to defy the heavens !

14
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:27,240
Always overcome the obstacles,

15
00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:29,600
ignite the seas with blood,

16
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:34,040
bloom through trials and tribulations.

17
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:38,680
Even the sharpest thorns

18
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:43,240
will be reduced into ashes.

19
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:47,560
What is there to fear ?

20
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:17,910
Such a thick death aura !

21
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,590
Senior Zhou Yi !

22
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,950
How can Ling Tianhou's sword formation

23
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,510
have demonic energy ?

24
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:36,990
Senior !

25
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,270
Wake up !

26
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,750
Senior,

27
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,110
still not waking up !?

28
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,030
Scram.

29
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,270
I thought that

30
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:03,150
Senior had decided to just watch the fight.

31
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,830
On the path to immortality,

32
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,390
there are many who deceive

33
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,870
and far too few who treat others with sincerity.

34
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,990
I didn't expect you to come.

35
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:16,670
You

36
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:17,790
should leave.

37
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:22,350
I initially thought you were just trapped here

38
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,790
but your body emanates a thick death aura.

39
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:28,310
Although that demonic energy is strange,

40
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,270
as the Rain Sword Spirit,

41
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,550
you shouldn't be in such a state.

42
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,470
Unless...

43
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,150
you don't want to live anymore.

44
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,750
Ling Tianhou trapped me

45
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:43,470
and plotted for the celestial swords

46
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,030
in the pursuit of strength.

47
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:48,790
The Water Demon Spirit worked with him

48
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,990
to seize my body

49
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:53,030
in order to survive.

50
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,950
But I...

51
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:57,950
She is already gone...

52
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,070
What else could I possibly seek ?

53
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,920
Your heart is already dead,

54
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,870
I indeed shouldn’t have come.

55
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,350
Wang Lin,

56
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,270
I'm sorry.

57
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:16,230
I have fulfilled my promise to guard this pagoda.

58
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:20,030
I give this pagoda back to you.

59
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,870
Ting'er...

60
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,590
Her name is not Ting'er.

61
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,550
If my guess is correct,

62
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,030
her true name

63
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,790
is Qing Shuang.

64
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,230
Qing Shuang ?

65
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,430
Qing Shuang

66
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:44,720
is the daughter of Celestial Emperor Qing Lin, the strongest person in the Celestial Realm.

67
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,390
And from what I know,

68
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:50,470
Qing Lin is very likely recovering in a cave somewhere in this Demon Spirit Land.

69
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,470
Ting'er...

70
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,190
If her father is really here,

71
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,470
there must be a way to bring Ting'er back to life !

72
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,670
Wang Lin,

73
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,630
are you certain ?

74
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:06,310
It depends on whether you want to gamble on this chance.

75
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,430
Scatter for me !

76
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,510
If I hadn't accepted to be imprisoned,

77
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,560
do you think a mere strand of Ling Tianhou's Divine Sense

78
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,870
is worthy

79
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:54,990
of stopping me !?

80
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:06,950
Let's leave !

81
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,800
My Sword Spirit body makes it difficult to store items.

82
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,560
Wang Lin,

83
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:19,790
please keep it safe.

84
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,030
I remember that,

85
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,990
there were 2 Celestial Swords inside the pagoda.

86
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,230
Is the other one

87
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,630
still with you ?

88
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:28,310
Yes.

89
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:31,260
Ah !

90
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,640
Senior, please spare my life !

91
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,750
This little one didn't know the sword had an owner !

92
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,350
If it wasn't for that fiend's orders,

93
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,910
I wouldn't have dared to claim it !

94
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,790
This Sword Spirit of yours is quite interesting.

95
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,390
Wang Lin,

96
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:50,670
although I can't pass the Celestial Sword's abilities to you,

97
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:54,430
I can let your Sword Spirit comprehend my ancient sword intent

98
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:57,950
to allow him to fully control the Celestial Sword.

99
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:00,510
Ancient sword intent ?

100
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,910
Master !

101
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:30,750
Your Sword Spirit has a rebellious nature.

102
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:34,430
It must have caused you plenty of trouble over the years.

103
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,790
From now on, you won't have to worry about it anymore.

104
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:44,030
I have left a mark within its consciousness.

105
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:46,270
If it dares to betray you in the future,

106
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:49,150
it will die from the backlash of the inheritance.

107
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,030
Thank you, Senior.

108
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,270
If you want to thank me,

109
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,990
it's still a bit too early.

110
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:08,710
Break !

111
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,590
Senior Zhou Yi !

112
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,160
You...

113
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,270
From now on,

114
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:19,910
this sword

115
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,990
fully belongs to you.

116
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:23,790
Henceforth,

117
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:26,310
even its original Sword Spirit

118
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:29,510
is no longer allowed to control this sword.

119
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:30,670
Senior...

120
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:31,830
This gift

121
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:33,190
is too much.

122
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,470
I am doing this for my own selfish reasons.

123
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:37,990
Wang Lin,

124
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,070
I just want one thing.

125
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:43,270
Help me find Ting'er's father.

126
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:44,710
Sure.

127
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,510
If Ting'er can wake up,

128
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,920
whether it's an inheritance

129
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,590
or a celestial sword,

130
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:55,470
none of them matter.

131
00:09:56,720 --> 00:10:00,270
I know that seeking the traces of the Celestial Emperor will not be easy.

132
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,630
Wang Lin,

133
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:04,990
I have one more opportunity for you.

134
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,870
If my senses are correct,

135
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:10,150
the previous generation's Rain Sword Spirit

136
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,990
is at the bottom of the Tide Abyss.

137
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:14,710
Come.

138
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:19,040
Bottom of the Tide Abyss

139
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:23,990
The tides of the East Demon Sea

140
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,910
likely originate from here.

141
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:29,550
I wonder how terrifying the power of the tide is

142
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:32,510
when it erupts every 500 years.

143
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:33,870
Be careful !

144
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:44,000
This purple mist can actually swallow Divine Sense !

145
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,670
This mist is too weird

146
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:46,920
for you to handle.

147
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:47,950
Get on !

148
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,360
Calm your breath and focus your mind.

149
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,750
Stabilize your energy,

150
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:56,040
don't let celestial spiritual energy escape.

151
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:58,950
Go !

152
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:01,550
Break !

153
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:02,630
Disperse !

154
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,910
Go !

155
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,790
Is the power of this Celestial Sword to your liking ?

156
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:08,190
It's excellent.

157
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,590
In that case,

158
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:11,720
I'm looking forward to that Sword Spirit even more !

159
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,270
Good !

160
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:16,510
Then hold tight !

161
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,400
We're almost there.

162
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:24,830
The Rain Sword Spirit !

163
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:36,510
Senior !

164
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,710
Senior !

165
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:05,390
Underworld...

166
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,430
River !

167
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,630
Go down...

168
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:29,800
Who is it !?

169
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,150
Go down...

170
00:12:43,760 --> 00:12:44,990
Go down...

171
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:47,670
Wang Lin,

172
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,760
focus your mind and guard your heart !

173
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:00,750
This Tide Abyss is truly treacherous.

174
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,630
I nearly fell for it.

175
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,630
The person in that scroll

176
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,350
kept telling me to go down.

177
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,390
I wonder what exactly

178
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:11,870
lies at the bottom of the abyss.

179
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:19,120
Previous generation's\NWealth Sword

180
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:22,430
When I entered the Heng Yue Sect,

181
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:32,240
This should have been in episode 1 but was cut.

182
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:25,910
I saw an identical sword in the Treasure Pavilion.

183
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,390
I suppose it was a replica...

184
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,030
It's been almost a thousand years.

185
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,190
The cultivation road is truly unpredictable,

186
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,830
and karma is unfathomable.

187
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:35,760
Wang Lin,

188
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,390
This place is weird.

189
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,670
The mist is getting denser.

190
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:45,070
This divine sense will lead to the formation I set at the exit.

191
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:47,150
Senior can just follow it.

192
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:55,480
Cloud Celestial Cave\NFire Demon Country

193
00:13:56,880 --> 00:13:57,670
Juan'er,

194
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,790
it's time to come out of seclusion.

195
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:11,200
What a wonderful Dao Couple !

196
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:12,990
I'm so envious !

197
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:13,910
Indeed !

198
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,440
Wang Wei\NCloud Celestial Couple\NNirvana Shatter

199
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,440
Hu Juan\NCloud Celestial Couple\NNirvana Shatter

200
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:19,590
That is...

201
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:20,070
This...

202
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:22,680
This is the descent of a Celestial Lord !

203
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:31,350
They actually left their cave !

204
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:34,510
I must speed up the devouring process.

205
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,070
Interesting.

206
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,430
This restriction is pretty clever.

207
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:05,430
It's a mix of ancient restrictions

208
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:08,030
with a hint of celestial restrictions.

209
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:14,390
Falseness

210
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,990
within truth.

211
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,590
To reach such a realm

212
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,510
one must have experienced both life and death,

213
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:21,240
and begun to comprehend the Dao,

214
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:23,350
even just a fraction of it.

215
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:27,990
To possess such a profound heart,

216
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:31,110
this person must be at least 10 000 years old.

217
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,390
I wouldn't be so sure.

218
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:36,310
Juan'er,

219
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:38,430
I'll make a bet with you.

220
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:41,190
If this person has cultivated for less than 10 000 years,

221
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,830
then I lose.

222
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:44,070
What do you say ?

223
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:47,830
Dear, you must know that

224
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:48,870
gambling

225
00:15:49,280 --> 00:15:50,750
is the best way to lose.

226
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:53,950
If you are greedy, you'll end up with nothing.

227
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:56,190
Your words are sharp.

228
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:58,030
Are you talking about me

229
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,030
or about Greed ?

230
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:02,350
Greed is insatiable.

231
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:04,030
His audacity is boundless.

232
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:06,960
He has repeatedly snuck into the Tide Abyss to investigate,

233
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,710
thinking he was invincible.

234
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:11,590
Little does he know that his movements

235
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:14,270
have long fallen within our calculations.

236
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:19,590
This man has likely developed an interest

237
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:22,510
for that token in the tide.

238
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:32,830
Senior Brother,

239
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,670
are you alright ?

240
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,350
It's nothing.

241
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:37,870
This king beast really is something.

242
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:39,190
If not for it,

243
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:41,670
how could we have been trapped here for 100 years ?

244
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:46,350
Senior Greed,

245
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:48,390
how much longer must you recover ?

246
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,670
Nephew Chen Long,

247
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:53,270
this old man...

248
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,870
That Mosquito Beast is unstoppable.

249
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:02,590
This time, my foundation has been injured.

250
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:05,390
It's not something that ordinary pills can heal.

251
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,870
Without proper recovery,

252
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:10,870
I fear my cultivation might drop.

253
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:12,390
I'm afraid that...

254
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:16,430
it will take another few decades

255
00:17:17,120 --> 00:17:19,670
to barely suppress my injuries.

256
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:34,670
What's attracting it ?

257
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,150
Senior,

258
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:38,560
Your Divine Sense can probe through this mist.

259
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,200
Could you take a look ?

260
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:43,990
It seems that

261
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:46,280
a swarm of beasts has gathered at the exit.

262
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:48,990
But I can't see clearly through the mist.

263
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,280
There also seems to be

264
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,350
6 people trapped at the exit.

265
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:56,950
One old

266
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,390
and 5 young.

267
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:01,550
Those outfits

268
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:04,030
look a bit familiar.

269
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:05,510
Senior,

270
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:07,550
can I look through your consciousness ?

271
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,350
It's the Da Lou Sword Sect !

272
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:22,520
Enemies meet on a narrow road.

273
00:18:23,880 --> 00:18:25,030
Beasts in front,

274
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:26,190
and mist behind.

275
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:28,790
It's not the best time to seek revenge.

276
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:31,150
How about

277
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,590
we leave first ?

278
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,430
According to what Yao Xixue said,

279
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:38,150
everyone is about to gather in the Tide Abyss

280
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:40,870
to get the token that opens the true Celestial Cave.

281
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,710
Greed will surely be among them.

282
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,430
In Hai Zhu's memory,

283
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,550
I saw that Greed summoned the 12 Swords to the Tide Abyss.

284
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:52,990
That was already 100 years ago...

285
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,550
The token...

286
