“From now on there are only three Rain Celestial Swords! As for this sword, it now belongs to you. Whether it is the Sword Spirit before me, me, or the Sword Spirit after me, we will have no right to control this sword!”\N\NWealth was entirely cut from the donghua among many other things that happened at the Heng Yue Sect. Wealth also made multiple appearances so far that were always cut. We're finally seeing it...\N\NWang Lin's test to join the Heng Yue Sect included a test of fate where the people's fate with artifacts of the sect was tested at the Treasure Pavilion. Wang Lin first saw Wealth back then but failed the test. Then Sun Dazhu gave Wealth to Wang Lin in order for him to parade with it during the Sect Competition to show their... wealth...\NWealth disappeared within the void when Wang Lin’s bag of holding was destroyed in episode 11.\NAfter exiting the Celestial Realm and asking Ting'er for a sword, Wang Lin ponders on the ressemblance between Wealth and the celestial sword he was given.\NWhen Wang Lin went back to Zhao in episode 93, he went back to the ruins of where the Heng Yue Sect had relocated. He found a jade there:\N“When I was 80, I had a dream that I was a Sword Spirit that swept the land. I was a king amongst swords.”\N“After I awakened, the sword from my dream remained engraved in my mind as if that was my life’s pursuit, as if that was my past life… I gave up on trying to break past the Foundation Establishment stage and focused on swordsmithing!”\N“This idea was so powerful that it felt like I was possessed. I was completely fixated on this; I had to create this sword!”\N“This old man was born in the Heng Yue Sect and would naturally die in the Heng Yue Sect. This old man opened up his furnace one last time to create a sword. I was short on time, so I gave up on precious materials and used mortal metals, then I created a large sword.”\N“After creating the sword. I suddenly felt a sign from the heavens, so I coated the sword in gold and soon it was shining.”\N“Looking at the sword, the feelings I experienced in my dream suddenly came back to me. At that moment, I was back in my dream and I was this sword’s spirit.”\N“That was the feeling I had been looking for. I named the sword Wealth. Although this name isn’t anything fancy, it was what I was feeling.”\N“My soul seemed to be completely merged with this sword, so I charged out and resolved the calamity for my Heng Yue Sect. Then, as I left, I left a sword technique inside the sword. I hope future disciples will treat the sword kindly.”

